H3200.def:
Someone descended from Jachin who was a man of the tribe of Simeon living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:10; 
son of: Simeon (H8095); 
brother of: Jemuel (H3223), Jamin (H3226), Ohad (H0161), Zerah (H2226L) and Shaul (H7586H); also called Jarib at 1 Chroniques 4:24; 
Group of ya.khin (יָכִין "Jachin" H3199) 
§ Jachinites , of Jachin "he will establish"
the descendants of Jachin

H3210.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:17; 
son of: Ezrah (H5834); 
brother of: Jether (H3500J), Mered (H4778) and Epher (H6081H) 
§ Jalon = "Jehovah lodges"
a son of Ezra and a descendant of Caleb

H3223.def:
A man of the tribe of Simeon living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:10; 
son of: Simeon (H8095); 
brother of: Jamin (H3226), Ohad (H0161), Jachin (H3199), Zerah (H2226L) and Shaul (H7586H); also called Nemuel at Nombres 26:12; 1x 
§ Jemuel = "day of God"
the eldest son of Simeon

H3224.def:
A woman living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Job 42:14; 
daughter of: Job (H0347); 
sister of: Keziah (H7103), Keren-happuch (H7163) 
§ Jemima = "day by day"
one of the daughters of Job born after the restoration

H3227B.def:
Someone descended from the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 35:18; 
son of: Israel (H3478) and Rachel (H7354); 
brother of: Joseph (H3130); 
half-brother of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Gad (H1410), Asher (H0836), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074) and Dinah (H1783); 
father of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Jamin at 1 Samuel 9:1,4; 22.7; 1x
Another spelling of bin.ya.min (בִּנְיָמִין "Benjamin" H1144)
§ Yamin (contraction of Ben-Yamin)

H3228G.def:
Someone descended from the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 35:18; 
son of: Israel (H3478) and Rachel (H7354); 
brother of: Joseph (H3130); 
half-brother of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Gad (H1410), Asher (H0836), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074) and Dinah (H1783); 
father of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Jamin at 1 Samuel 9:1,4; 22.7; 1x
Another spelling of bin.ya.min (בִּנְיָמִין "Benjamin" H1144)
§ Jaminites , of Jamin "the right hand"
the descendants of Jamin

H3228H.def:
Someone descended from Jamin who was a man of the tribe of Simeon living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:10; 
son of: Simeon (H8095); 
brother of: Jemuel (H3223), Ohad (H0161), Jachin (H3199), Zerah (H2226L) and Shaul (H7586H)
Group of ya.min (יָמִין "Jamin" H3226)
§ Jaminites , of Jamin "the right hand"
the descendants of Jamin

H3232G.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:17; 
son of: Asher (H0836); 
brother of: Ishvah (H3438), Ishvi (H3440), Beriah (H1283) and Serah (H8294); also called Imnite at Nombres 26:44; 
§ Imna or Imnah or Jimnah = "right hand"
1) the 1st born son of Asher
2) a Levite, descendant of Imnah, who assisted in the reforms of Hezekiah
n patr
3) descendants of Imnah, son of Asher

H3234.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:35; 
son of: Hotham (H2369); 
brother of: Zophah (H6690), Shelesh (H8028) and Amal (H6000) 
§ Imna = "He will restrain"
son of Helem, descendant of Asher, and leader of the tribe of Asher

H3236.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:36; 
son of: Zophah (H6690); 
brother of: Suah (H5477), Harnepher (H2774), Shual (H7777B), Beri (H1275), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030), Ithran (H3506H) and Beera (H0878) 
§ Imrah = "bitterness"
a descendant of Asher of the family of Zophah and a chief of the tribe

H3252.def:
A woman living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Genèse 11:29; 
daughter of: Haran (H2039); 
sister of: Lot (H3876) and Milcah (H4435) 
§ Iscah = "one who looks forth"
daughter of Haran, niece of Abraham, sister of Lot and Milcah

H3258H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:9; 
son of: Koz (H6976)(?); 
brother of: Anub (H6036)(?), Zobebah (H6637)(?) and Harum (H2037)(?)
§ Jabez = "sorrow"
1) the head of a Calebite family
2) a town in Judah apparently near Bethlehem

H3263.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:10; 
son of: Shaharaim (H7842) and Hodesh (H2321); 
brother of: Jobab (H3103J), Zibia (H6644), Mesha (H4331), Malcam (H4445A), Sachia (H7634), Mirmah (H4821), Abitub (H0036) and Elpaal (H0508) 
§ Jeuz = "counsellor"
head of a house of Benjamin

H3266G.def:
A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:5; 
son of: Esau (H6215) and Oholibamah (H0173); 
brother of: Jalam (H3281) and Korah (H7141); 
half-brother of: Eliphaz (H0464) and Reuel (H7467)
Also named: ye.ish (יְעִישׁ "Jeush" H3274)
§ Jehush or Jeush = "He hurries to aid"
1) son of Eshek, a remote descendant of king Saul
2) a Gershonite Levite of the house of Shimei
3) son of king Rehoboam of Judah

H3266K.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 2 Chroniques 11:19; 
son of: Rehoboam (H7346) and Mahalath (H4258H); 
brother of: Shemariah (H8114H), Zaham (H2093); 
half-brother of: Abijah (H0029I), Attai (H6262I), Ziza (H2124H) and Shelomith (H8019G)
§ Jehush or Jeush = "He hurries to aid"
1) son of Eshek, a remote descendant of king Saul
2) a Gershonite Levite of the house of Shimei
3) son of king Rehoboam of Judah

H3269.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 24:26; 
son of: Merari (H4847); 
brother of: Mahli (H4249) and Mushi (H4187); 
father of: Beno (H1121B), Shoham (H7719), Zaccur (H2139I) and Ibri (H5681) 
§ Jaaziah = "made bold by Jehovah"
a Levite, apparently the 3rd son or a descendant of Merari

H3275.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 5:13; 
son of: Abihail (H0032I); 
brother of: Michael (H4317H), Meshullam (H4918I), Sheba (H7652), Jorai (H3140), Zia (H2127) and Eber (H5677H) 
§ Jachan = "troublesome"
one of seven chief men of the tribe of Gad

H3279.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esdras 2:56; also called Jaala at Néhémie 7:58; 
§ Jaala or Jaalah = "ascending"
the head of a family of the descendants of Solomon's slaves who returned from exile with Zerubbabel

H3281.def:
A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:5; 
son of: Esau (H6215) and Oholibamah (H0173); 
brother of: Jeush (H3266) and Korah (H7141); 
half-brother of: Eliphaz (H0464) and Reuel (H7467) 
§ Jaalam = "concealed"
an Edomite, descendant of Esau

H3290.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 25:26; 
son of: Isaac (H3327) and Rebekah (H7259); 
brother of: Esau (H6215); married to Rachel (H7354), Leah (H3812), Zilpah (H2153) and Bilhah (H1090A); 
father of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Gad (H1410), Asher (H0836), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074), Dinah (H1783), Joseph (H3130) and Benjamin (H1144); also called Jacob frequently
Another name of yis.ra.el (יִשְׂרָאֵל "Israel" H3478) 
§ Jacob = "heel holder" or "supplanter"
son of Isaac, grandson of Abraham, and father of the 12 patriarchs of the tribes of Israel

H3292.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:27; 
son of: Ezer (H0687); 
brother of: Bilhan (H1092) and Zaavan (H2190)
Also named: a.qan (עֲקָן "Akan" H6130) 
§ Jakan = "let him oppress them"
an Edomite

H3294.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:36; 
son of: Ahaz (H0271H); 
father of: Alemeth (H5964I), Azmaveth (H5820H) and Zimri (H2174H); also called Jarah at 1 Chroniques 9:42; 
Another name of ye.ho.ad.dah (יְהוֹעַדָּה "Jehoaddah" H3085) 
§ Jarah = "forested"
a descendant of Saul, son of Micah, great grandson of Mephibosheth

H3298.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:27; 
son of: Jeroham (H3395H); 
brother of: Shamsherai (H8125), Shehariah (H7841), Athaliah (H6271H), Elijah (H0452H) and Zichri (H2147J) 
§ Jaresiah = "whom Jehovah nourishes"
a Benjamite, one of the descendants of Jehoram
